{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22097","headline":"永崇里观居 · 白居易","name":"永崇里观居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"季夏中气侯，烦暑自此收。\n萧飒风雨天，蝉声暮啾啾。\n永崇里巷静，华阳观院幽。\n轩车不到处，满地槐花秋。\n年光忽冉冉，世事本悠悠。\n何必待衰老，然後悟浮休。\n真隐岂长远，至道在冥搜。\n身虽世界住，心与虚无游。\n朝饥有蔬食，夜寒有布裘。\n幸免冻与馁，此外复何求。\n寡慾虽少病，乐天心不忧。\n何以明吾志，周易在牀头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}